Here’s a suitable `.gitignore` for the full-stack Gallery App:

```gitignore
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
build/
client/dist/
server/dist/

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

# Uploaded images
server/uploads/*
!server/uploads/.gitkeep

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE / Editor
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/

# TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo

# Coverage
coverage/

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/

# Vite
.vite/
```